NjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2024-11-14T22:11:23Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T15:41:38Z","closed_at":"2024-11-15T20:56:01Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\r\n\r\nReproducible in 4.4 dev4, not reproducible in 4.3 stable and 4.4 dev3\r\n\r\n### System information\r\n\r\nGodot v4.4.dev4 - Windows 10.0.19045 - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - AMD Ryzen 5 1500X Quad-Core Processor (8 threads)\r\n\r\n### Issue description\r\n\r\nI am applying a shader to a Line2D node. The shader is a Voronoi edge shader based on https://iquilezles.org/articles/voronoilines/ and https://www.shadertoy.com/view/ldl3W8\r\nThe rendering method is Forward+\r\n\r\nBefore 4.4 dev4 it looks correct: \r\n![working](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a5534a99-5e6d-4bd9-9675-fd4430b9b5ef)\r\n\r\nOn 4.4 dev4 rapid flickering has appeared:\r\n![broken](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9643c5a3-9600-40df-be4e-e6af14c12261)\r\n\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nOpen the MRP with 4.4 dev4 and observe the issue. I have noticed that the static (non-animated) version where the regions do not move works - you can see it by commenting out lines 29 and 49, both are:\r\n```point = 0.5 + 0.5*sin(TIME * frequency_road + 6.2831*point);```\r\nso perhaps the issue is with this calculation\r\n\r\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\r\n\r\n[shader_bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17758427/shader_bug.zip)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99252/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99252/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}